WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Plastic in rivers flows straight to the ocean.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.700
In Amsterdam, a wall of bubbles stops it.

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.140
The bubbles push plastic to the side while fish and boats pass right through.

4
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:12.080
The company says it has caught over one million pieces since 2019.

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.720
Saving a planet is saving people.

6
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.700
Follow Saving Planets.

